; autumn_trial.room - the autumn song trials (docs/maps/README.md).
;
; Vendaval, "Empurrado pelo Vendaval" (design 02 section 8, Outono Espacial 2):
; a 16-cell chasm over water with a natural current blowing across it. Neither
; a running jump (8.5 cells), nor the current alone (about 12), nor the gale
; alone (about 15) clears it - played three cells back from the edge, the gale
; ADDS to the current (one Airflow channel) and carries the jump across
; (about 17). Sized for base movement: the trials grant no skills.
; tests/scenes/world/rooms/trials/autumn_trial_test.gd holds the numbers.

[room]
origin = 0, -16

